  "Ringle shoots arrows by itself. Tap to turn the bow! Pop balloons to drop the triangles, and coin balloons give lots of points. If a triangle crosses the red line it's over!": "Ringle 會自動射箭。點一下轉動弓!射破氣球讓三角形掉下來,金幣氣球分數很高。三角形越過紅線就結束!",
  "Ringle runs by itself. Tap to change shape: circle → triangle → square! Match the hole in the wall to slip through. Three bumps and you're out!": "Ringle 會自己跑。點一下變形:圓形 → 三角形 → 方形!跟牆上的洞一樣就能穿過。撞 3 次就出局!",
  "The cards show for a moment. Remember the numbers and flip the same numbers one after another! Pairs in a row give you more time.": "卡片只會出現一下下。記住數字,接連翻出相同的數字!連續配對可以加時間。",
