  "An arrow spins around your Ringle. Dash to push the triangles off the stage! The last team standing wins.": "箭頭繞著 Ringle 轉。衝刺把三角形推出舞台!最後留下的隊伍獲勝。",
  "Tap left or right to steer your boat. Dodge the triangles and sail between the buoys! The last team standing wins.": "點左邊或右邊操控小船。躲開三角形,從浮標中間穿過!最後留下的隊伍獲勝。",
  "Tap left or right to climb the stairs. Tap the side with no stair and you fall! Climb fast for double points! The last team standing wins.": "點左邊或右邊爬樓梯。點到沒有樓梯的一邊就會掉下去!爬得快分數加倍!最後留下的隊伍獲勝。",
  "Tap the play button to run and stop when the tagger turns around! Get caught moving and you are out. The one who goes farthest wins.": "點播放鍵就跑,鬼轉頭時要停下!動的時候被抓到就出局。走最遠的人獲勝。",
  "Spin the floor with the buttons and drop through the holes! You can only bounce so many times, and watch out for triangles. The last one left wins.": "用按鈕轉動地板,從洞裡掉下去!能彈跳的次數有限,也要小心三角形。最後留下的人獲勝。",
  "On your turn move one step or place a wall! Block your friends with walls and reach the other side first to win.": "輪到你時走一步或放一道牆!用牆擋住朋友,先到對面就贏了。",
  "Place a Ringle and the board spins! Nudge your friends' Ringles and line up yours in a row.": "放下 Ringle 棋盤就會轉!推動朋友的 Ringle,把自己的排成一列。",
  "More mini-games are on the way.": "更多小遊戲即將推出。",
